&_nc_oc=Adqsezyqq7DicsFhUDDtq23ZjvWA12VtJKT2KyQXKsjJGHrotUyoCJLqRDUHdsa1sZw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGMZJ7bSrZNNThZ3Vj1gaCcnw72OPRs9ETkr8oZkE06_w&oe=6A92BF7E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FzKzc6cMDm8Q7kNvwG93aZH&_nc_oc=AdqVnnUjrG-kjg3HUPfnPWHkzcEfqIbJ_eQmw1IL_3LEmaCrwnGlqRSCy1l35L1jVGk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGMBtPwy4jROYHJQadLkOQRb0HkFP6Hr4eoAuPArLpDUw&oe=6A92D07C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SFGkhcgM3KQQ7kNvwEvGs47&_nc_oc=AdpReSAXccLEu3RzPhvofAMpN5AhVUqgp97v_K6SNbsYDym9TOOB_YocEILFDNgtYSA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE40gl2iwVuYR4FpO25ETJl4ZecvgN_2VeAW3Y6wBfP2A&oe=6A92B6C7"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UCW7gqOIWpEQ7kNvwG46BQB&_nc_oc=Adq902VQTZcV64xI2aSjW6blrDjYxxC9cJ9DHlTG2ZiDus_MHeBhmAc7zxR7LnSCrD8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHMdHoCNZoRGh078s9e6vasvdkFpWYrQ38ORpkE_HdTXg&oe=6A92DAD5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wuZiIpyIpaIQ7kNvwEId0XW&_nc_oc=Ado4qCF_03FW6MLubhaXvE6OTHbuv9JMQmC5EXVodqbZt6ZYv2UhuoP6Iaio5hTY6dc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEEHuo4H22O2_iusmsVTSy0YGXnogUxeX9hUCAoxAUWqw&oe=6A92AF24"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.